# Yarn's runtime stays OUT of the repo: the version is pinned by
# `packageManager` in package.json and fetched by Corepack. Do not add a
# `yarnPath` to .yarnrc.yml — it would point at a path this rule excludes, and
# a fresh clone would have no package manager.
